# Collective Brutality's "Target opponent loses 2 life and you gain 2 life" with its opponent no longer a legal target
# (CR 608.2b): Bot1 escalates, giving its own Llanowar Elves -2/-2 and draining Bot2, and Bot2 gains protection from
# everything with Teferi's Protection in response. The -2/-2 mode keeps the spell resolving and the Elves dies; Bot2 loses
# nothing, but the gain does not use the target, so Bot1 still gains 2 life (the ruling on escalate's modes: the rest of
# the mode's instructions still happen).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Swamp
Llanowar Elves
Collective Brutality
Demonic Tutor
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Teferi's Protection
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Collective Brutality.Cast
Bot1.Modes(2; 3)
Bot1.Target(Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Demonic Tutor)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Teferi's Protection.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves = (absent)
Exile = Teferi's Protection
Bot1.Life = 22
Bot2.Life = 20
